		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Vampire with one nostril, rat- like features, and long claws. Wears rags, lurks in the dark.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +3 (1d8 + blood drain), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Backstab</strong>. Deal x2 damage against surprised creatures.</p><p></p><p><strong>Blood Drain</strong>. Vampire heals 2d6 HP, target takes 1d4 CON and 1d4 WIS damage. At 0 CON or 0 WIS, target dies.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stealthy</strong>. ADV on DEX checks to sneak and hide.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
